# Generated content. These patterns name the legacy top-level output directories, so anchor
# them: an unanchored `subtitles/` also matched e2e/fixtures/subtitles/, which silently kept two
# committed-looking test fixtures out of the repository entirely -- every journey that imports
# them passed here and would have failed in any fresh clone.
/videos/
/subtitles/
/narration/output/
/narration/temp/
/narration/reference/

